tyResearchFoundation", "duration": 5614, "uploader": "Vaccine Safety Research Foundation", "live_status": "was_live", "webpage_url": "https://rumble.com/v6vwrza-episode-185-overcoming-systemic-corruption-tragedy-and-loss.html", "webpage_url_basename": "v6vwrza-episode-185-overcoming-systemic-corruption-tragedy-and-loss.html", "webpage_url_domain": "rumble.com", "extractor": "RumbleEmbed", "extractor_key": "RumbleEmbed", "release_timestamp": 1752188418, "view_count": 10561, "like_count": 167, "dislike_count": 1, "description": "Due to last-minute unforeseen circumstances, Mikki Willis will not be joining us tonight. We look forward to welcoming him back on a future episode.Show more Standing in will be our own host Steve Kirsch who will walk us through his recent bombshell letter to the CDC Steve Kirsch walks us through his recent letter to the CDC, where he poses eight critical questions challenging the studies used to claim that COVID-19 vaccines reduce all-cause mortality. Steve exposes serious flaws in the data—particularly the failure to account for the Healthy Vaccinee Effect (HVE) and Non-Proportional Hazards (NPH)—and calls on the CDC to respond with real, transparent evidence.\nAlso, we’re joined by Amanda Damian, who has been leading search and recovery efforts in Sandy Creek, Texas, following the catastrophic floods. With no state or federal aid, Amanda offers a powerful, firsthand account of the devastation—and how the community is surviving through grassroots support, perseverance, and faith.\nDonations are tax deductible and we need your support to continue our work into 2024. Or to text-to-donate, text VSRF to 53-555 Show less", "thumbnail": "https://1a-1791.com/video/fww1/b7/s8/1/M/Y/A/0/MYA0y.qR4e.1-small-Episode-185-Overcoming-Syst.jpg", "display_id": "v6tpvqg", "fulltitle": "Episode 185: Shocking CDC Error In COVID Vaccine Mortality Benefit?", "duration_string": "1:33:34", "upload_date": "20250708", "release_date": "20250710", "release_year": 2025,